The [[Image:Silk_ControlGrid44_EdgeSegment.svg|32px]] '''Silk ControlGrid44_EdgeSegment''' command creates a ControlGrid44 from a [[Image:Silk_CubicSurface_44.svg|16px]] [[Silk_CubicSurface_44|CubicSurface_44]] and one [[Image:Silk_CubicCurve_4.svg|16px]] [[Silk_CubicCurve_4|CubicCurve_4]] segment.

