==Usage==

# Select in the [[3D_View|3D View]]:
## A CubicSurface_44.
## A CubicCurve_4 that matches part of an edge of that surface.
# There are several ways to invoke the command.
#* Press the {{Button|[[Image:Silk_ControlGrid44_EdgeSegment.svg|16px]] ControlGrid44_EdgeSegment}} button.
#* Select the {{MenuCommand|Silk → [[Image:Silk_ControlGrid44_EdgeSegment.svg|16px]] ControlGrid44_EdgeSegment}} option from the menu.
# A '''ControlGrid44_EdgeSegment''' object, is created.

